              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "can be used within animation blocks to animate the carousel to a new selected value. For",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "animations it is recommended to call these functions with the parameter ",
